  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "189b6a47-b8cd-488d-979c-a41c493fa353",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "0cc0cfb6-7249-dcc4-a5c7-38c2e5f620a9",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Professor Rizvi, who chairs the department of obstetrics and gynaecology at AKU, has been awarded for his contributions to research in assisted reproduction as well as work in undergraduate and postgraduate medical education. Dr Rizvi's forte lies in gynaecology, medical education and curriculum design, and he has also performed ground-breaking work in infertility. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In the area of assisted reproductive technology, he has rendered invaluable service to the community by establishing the Concept Infertility Centre in Karachi. He is vice president of the Assisted Reproductive Technology (ART) Society of Pakistan and a member of Rotunda Fertility Services' International Advisory Committee. He is also a member of the Asia Pacific Continence Advisory Board and Urogynaecology Committee of the Asian Federation of Obstetrics and Gynaecology.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
